# Container mode. Everything above that is not left out stays. This leaves out what needs a desktop, systemd or launchd, and the files of tools the container does not install
# (the lean set is dot_config/mise/conf.d/container.toml.tmpl). A new path is in the pod unless it is listed here; tests/container-mode names the exact set that stays.
# Run scripts: only the five below run (the tools, the harness config, agent-kit, and the two git settings a pod needs to push and commit). A script nobody listed is left out, so a new one never reaches the pod unseen, and plain `chezmoi verify` has no always-pending run_after
# script to fail on (c6). The list is computed, not written: every run_ script in the source root, minus these.
